#: prefs.js
msgid "Smart Top Bar"
msgstr "Baar sare oo caqli leh"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Shake twice at the top edge to reveal"
msgstr "Laba jeer bidix iyo midig uga dhaqaaji geeska sare si aad u muujiso"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Hide when maximized or tiled. Never reveal in true fullscreen."
msgstr "Qari marka daaqadaha la ballaariyo ama dhinac la isu dhigo. Ha muujin shaashad buuxda oo dhab ah."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Keep the pointer within 3 pixels of the primary screen’s top edge and move left and right twice."
msgstr "Tilmaamaha ku hay 3 biksal gudahood geeska sare ee shaashadda weyn oo laba jeer bidix iyo midig u dhaqaaji."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Stroke distance"
msgstr "Masaafada dhaqdhaqaaq kasta"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Logical pixels; larger values reduce accidental reveals."
msgstr "Biksallo macquul ah; qiime weyn wuxuu yareeyaa muujinta kama’a ah."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Gesture time limit"
msgstr "Waqtiga ugu badan ee tilmaanta"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Milliseconds to complete all four alternating strokes."
msgstr "Millisekanno lagu dhammaystirayo afarta dhaqdhaqaaq ee isdhaafsan."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Hide delay"
msgstr "Dib u dhaca qarinta"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Milliseconds after leaving; open menus and keyboard navigation keep the bar visible."
msgstr "Millisekanno ka dib marka laga tago; liisaska furan iyo isticmaalka kiiboodhku waxay baarka ka dhigaan mid muuqda."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Shortcut: Super + Ctrl + B"
msgstr "Soo gaabin: Super + Ctrl + B"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Reveal or hide temporarily. Disabled in true fullscreen; press Super to use the overview."
msgstr "Si ku meel gaar ah u muuji ama u qari. Kama shaqayso shaashad buuxda oo dhab ah; riix Super si aad u aragto dulmarka."
